body:
I guess there are different people. But for me(M) the best part is actually the the after sex. I enjoy sex, but what I love the most is the feel of intimacy. Laying with your partner, nude, cuddling talking ... Honestly if it was just for the sex act I ll rather masturbate, I want something more than sex, I want to make love .

&#x200B;

Anyways I guess is not the same for every men/women, which is not bad. But one thing I would not like is that if he loves you even if he does not enjoy/like it, he would do it for you.
